{"title":"Stag Beetle","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 21 Beetle that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 2</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>33</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>21</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>19</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>33</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"caustic-gland\" title=\"Caustic Gland - in 8 of 8 looted corpses, 8 recorded drops, 8 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a365aa4e65ef66352ad8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Caustic Gland</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 6 of 8 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 6 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iridescent-carapace\" title=\"Iridescent Carapace - in 4 of 8 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/be9151e50c9d8d997175.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iridescent Carapace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"beetle-mandible\" title=\"Beetle Mandible - in 3 of 8 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8872c8debf3517cce963.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Beetle Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Haunted Cavern</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 52</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-110\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Beetle: <a href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle\">Rhinoceros Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bombardier-beetle\">Bombardier Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/0de75c266afab56361c3.webp\" alt=\"Stag Beetle\"></div><h3>Stag Beetle</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>21</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 21)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Beetle</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>70</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>16.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}